<title>USA: Cable Car Beverage Corp Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Cable Car Beverage Corp Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CABLE CAR BEVERAGE CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>(UNAUDITED)					  THREE-MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>							    MARCH 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net sales				    $5,357,864   $3,682,809</p>
<p> Gross profit				  1,517,699	985,908</p>
<p> Operating expenses			    945,612	705,709</p>
<p> Income from operations			572,087	280,199</p>
<p> Net income					350,992	173,356</p>
<p> Net income per share				.04	    .02</p>
<p> Common and common equivalent shares   9,440,334    9,041,650</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
